<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Tandy near-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Tandy near-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Tuesday it had cut Tandy Corp's near-term rating to neutral from accumulate. Merrill kept its long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Tandy said Monday it would take a $170 million fourth quarter charge to sell its 17-store Incredible Universe retail chain and close 19 Computer City stores.</p>
</text>
